Lava fire-tail frames from tools/lava_harness, 16 ms/frame, light switch D7 ON,
mushroom D11 pressed (after arming). A0=1023 (fader open), A1=512 (centre speed).

col: * ball (palette red), W white-yellow, Y yellow, O orange, r red tail, . off.
     Read from the ball outward, the tail is W/Y then O then r.
bri: brightest shown channel as a digit, 9 ≈ BRIGHTNESS_CAP 50.
behind: lit LEDs opposite the direction of travel, outside the ball.
ahead: lit LEDs in front of the ball. A one-sided tail stays at 0.
Physics peak is pos/fix. Centre of 160 LEDs is 79.5. The apex row lights LEDs 79 and 80.
visMaxLed0 can read 81 because the falling tail points past the ball, toward higher LEDs.

